 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure shown to determine whether the sequence of vertices in the given graph is a Hamilton path, an Euler trail, both, or neither.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/a324fff3c9dd229b.png\" alt=\"Two graphs are labeled graph A and graph K. Graph A has five vertices: b, c, d, e, and f. Edges connect b c, c f, b d, b e, d e, and e f. Graph K has five vertices: m, n, o, p, and q. Edges connect m n, n o, n q, q o, o p, n p, and m p.\">\n",
